| -------------------- | ---------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| 阿拉伯语（埃及）     | ar-EG      | [AG_GRID_LOCALE_EG](https://github.com/ag-grid/ag-grid/tree/latest/community-modules/locale/src/ar-EG.ts) |
| 保加利亚语           | bg-BG      | [AG_GRID_LOCALE_BG](https://github.com/ag-grid/ag-grid/tree/latest/community-modules/locale/src/bg-BG.ts) |
| 中文（繁体）         | zh-HK      | [AG_GRID_LOCALE_HK](https://github.com/ag-grid/ag-grid/tree/latest/community-modules/locale/src/zh-HK.ts) |
| 中文（简体）         | zh-CN      | [AG_GRID_LOCALE_CN](https://github.com/ag-grid/ag-grid/tree/latest/community-modules/locale/src/zh-CN.ts) |
| 中文（台湾）         | zh-TW      | [AG_GRID_LOCALE_TW](https://github.com/ag-grid/ag-grid/tree/latest/community-modules/locale/src/zh-TW.ts) |
